==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4~20 seconds<sup>120f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 1~4 seconds<sup>30f~120f</sup>.
**3 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], bring it, as it allows you to more easily handle the Kories. Otherwise, bring cheap, spammable meatshields and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], like you would for [[Labyrinth of Hades]].

